OL,5,G0855 Storage Wars: Texas
OL,6,     FIt's a sizzler in Dallas-Fort
OL,7,     FWorth - and a chunk of the buyers
OL,8,     Fhaven't braved the 40-degree heat.
OL,9,     FBut that's not why Dr. Moe missed
OL,10,     Fit. He was performing a bunion
OL,11,     Fsurgery instead.
